Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.00,Rina Honnizumi,,0,0,0,corner,=== Corner: Opening Talk ===
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.00,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Good evening,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.08,0:00:06.14,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.14,0:00:09.56,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}I'm Rina Honnizumi,\Nthe voice of Shizuku Hinomori from MORE MORE JUMP!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.04,0:00:11.18,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Good evening, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.18,0:00:14.68,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}I'm Minori Suzuki,\Nthe voice of Ena Shinonome from Nightcord at 25:00.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.68,0:00:15.36,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.37,0:00:15.87,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.92,0:00:19.80,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Sekaraji is a radio program brought to you by the cast of the smartphone game
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.80,0:00:23.88,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Project SEKAI COLORFUL STAGE! feat. Hatsune Miku.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.88,0:00:26.32,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}The two of us will be your hosts for this episode.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.04,0:00:28.36,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}It's the big sisters.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.25,0:00:28.77,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.77,0:00:33.48,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}I don't think we've ever had a pair of big sisters together like this before.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.68,0:00:37.76,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}The script says "the two big sisters,"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.76,0:00:41.08,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}but I just thought we were called in because we're good friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.08,0:00:46.16,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}I thought it was because Ena and Shizuku-chan are close,\Nbut it turns out it's because we're both big sisters.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.72,0:00:49.32,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Wow, you're right. I just realized that too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.40,0:00:54.12,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Yeah, sometimes it's hard to tell\Nwhich one of us is the older sister...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.12,0:00:57.21,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}or rather, it's hard to tell\Nwhich one of us is the more mature one in our relationship.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.05,0:00:57.65,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.21,0:00:58.16,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.65,0:00:58.25,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.16,0:01:01.32,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}So, the two of us will be hosting today's show.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.44,0:01:02.60,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}By the way, Ringo-chan,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.20,0:01:04.80,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}do you have any siblings?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.69,0:01:05.37,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.37,0:01:06.28,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}I'm an older sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.16,0:01:06.66,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Wait,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.66,0:01:07.19,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}really?
Comment: 0,0:01:07.32,0:01:09.44,Rina Honnizumi,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary — review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.32,0:01:09.44,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}You seem like you'd have a younger sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.60,0:01:10.48,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Are you an older sister in real life?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.60,0:01:11.56,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}I am an older sister in real life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.64,0:01:12.44,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Just the two of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.72,0:01:13.92,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Yeah, it's just the two of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.81,0:01:14.53,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.53,0:01:15.64,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}What about you, Minori?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.76,0:01:16.68,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}I'm very much an only child.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.69,0:01:17.19,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.36,0:01:19.00,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.03,0:01:19.53,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.68,0:01:23.48,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}But since you're like Shizuku, I just assumed you had one.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.68,0:01:24.35,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}An older sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.32,0:01:24.84,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.35,0:01:25.00,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.00,0:01:25.50,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.56,0:01:28.92,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Yeah, but just like Shizuku, I figured you'd be the type where
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.92,0:01:30.92,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}your younger sister is basically the older one.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.40,0:01:32.80,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}I feel like that would be the case for me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.77,0:01:33.27,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.40,0:01:35.39,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}I'd probably rely on them a lot if I had siblings.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.39,0:01:36.08,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.49,0:01:35.99,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.08,0:01:38.20,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}But you seem to get cast in older sister roles a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.76,0:01:42.84,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}That's true.\NI do get cast as the older sister quite often, thankfully.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.36,0:01:44.52,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Ah, that's lovely to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.08,0:01:46.60,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.24,0:01:52.24,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Anyway, this episode is apparently being released on August 28th.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.24,0:01:57.08,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}It seems like school has already started in some places.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.24,0:01:58.42,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}That's a shocker.
Comment: 0,0:01:58.42,0:02:07.06,Rina Honnizumi,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary — review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.42,0:02:03.80,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}When Ena was in elementary and middle school,\Nsummer break lasted until the 31st,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.80,0:02:07.06,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}so around this time, Ena was probably thinking...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.06,0:02:11.92,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}"I can still make it! I don't have to start my homework yet!"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.08,0:02:14.28,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Yeah, on the 28th, you still feel like you're fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.40,0:02:16.84,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Exactly. It's not until the 30th that...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.04,0:02:18.00,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}You finally start...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.85,0:02:19.35,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}...getting serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.12,0:02:22.48,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}The real struggle is about to begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.68,0:02:23.62,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.62,0:02:24.36,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Totally.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.36,0:02:27.44,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}But some people have school today, so good luck to you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.56,0:02:29.04,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}That's true. It's Friday today.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.44,0:02:33.64,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}So for those who've already started,\Nyou've got the weekend to look forward to.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.24,0:02:36.00,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Man, that's tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.16,0:02:39.22,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Good luck with your homework, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.22,0:02:40.00,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Let's do our best.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.00,0:02:41.64,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Wait, were you the type to finish it early, Shizuku?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.77,0:02:42.27,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.25,0:02:42.88,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.88,0:02:43.51,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.03,0:02:44.53,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.76,0:02:49.28,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Ena would put it off until the very last second,\Nthinking she was fine, and then end up suffering for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.52,0:02:50.24,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Shizuku was the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.35,0:02:50.92,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.92,0:02:51.76,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}That's surprising.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.92,0:02:58.68,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Every year on the 31st, Shizuku would be crying\Nwhile watching that 24-hour charity telethon...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.24,0:03:00.80,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}...and working on her independent research project.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.48,0:03:06.32,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}They always say you should be more organized with those projects,\Nbut...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.23,0:03:06.73,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.32,0:03:11.08,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}There's a certain charm to finishing it at the last minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.31,0:03:08.81,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Yeah.
Comment: 0,0:03:11.20,0:03:12.44,Rina Honnizumi,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary — review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.20,0:03:12.44,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Oh, yeah, that's true. That happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.53,0:03:13.03,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}It adds character.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.08,0:03:15.04,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}It's a memory of something that happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.09,0:03:15.59,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.55,0:03:16.05,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}A memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.60,0:03:19.60,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Well then, let's get started with this episode of Sekaraji.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.28,0:03:30.04,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}This program is brought to you by Project SEKAI Colorful Stage! feat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.04,0:03:32.36,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Hatsune Miku.
Comment: 0,0:03:37.00,0:03:39.04,Rina Honnizumi,,0,0,0,corner,=== Corner: Contact Notebook ===
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.00,0:03:39.04,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Once again, I'm Rina Honnizumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.20,0:03:40.20,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}And I'm Minori Suzuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.44,0:03:43.76,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}So, we have another question in the contact notebook.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.43,0:03:43.93,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.76,0:03:47.88,Rina Honnizumi,host_meta,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}This one is from Noguchi-san and 25-san,\Nwho were on the last episode.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.81,0:03:48.31,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.84,0:03:52.60,Rina Honnizumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}The question is: "What's something fun you did this summer, or something you're looking forward to?"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.96,0:03:55.04,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Summer is almost over, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.36,0:03:57.52,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Ringo-chan, did you get to do anything this summer?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.79,0:03:58.32,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.32,0:03:59.04,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}I did a lot!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.86,0:03:59.36,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Wait, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.36,0:03:59.87,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.00,0:04:01.28,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}I just did something, it's fresh in my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.36,0:04:04.00,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}I went on a solo trip...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.12,0:04:07.96,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}That sounds amazing! ...and for the first time in my life,\NI traveled by boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.86,0:04:08.36,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.36,0:04:09.00,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}That's incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.16,0:04:12.80,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Yeah, I went to Hokkaido.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.09,0:04:11.59,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.88,0:04:13.40,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}From Tokyo?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.56,0:04:19.92,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}From Tokyo, I took the train to Mito,\Nthen another train to a place called Oarai,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.92,0:04:23.04,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}and from there, I took a ferry... yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.68,0:04:25.16,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}I went all the way to Hokkaido.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.96,0:04:26.48,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}That sounds like so much fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.84,0:04:30.92,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}It was! I boarded the ship around 8:00 PM, and then...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.92,0:04:35.92,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}I arrived in Hokkaido just after 1:00 PM the next day.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.04,0:04:37.40,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}So you arrive just past noon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.52,0:04:44.60,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Exactly. It was my first time spending such a long time on a boat,\Nso I was worried about getting seasick,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.60,0:04:46.29,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}but it turns out I'm the type who's totally fine.
Comment: 0,0:04:46.29,0:04:47.01,Rina Honnizumi,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary — review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.29,0:04:47.01,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.73,0:04:48.41,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.41,0:04:51.75,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}I love looking at the ocean,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.75,0:05:00.96,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}so I got a room with a view and just spent the whole trip staring at the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.08,0:05:02.40,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}And you had dinner on the ship too?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.80,0:05:08.84,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Yeah, it was a buffet. The ship was swaying,\Nso everyone was being super careful while carrying their food.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.80,0:05:10.44,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}I bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.88,0:05:17.58,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}It was pretty funny. There were quite a few solo travelers,\Nbut since it was that time of year, there were lots of families.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.58,0:05:23.66,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}I kept thinking how much fun it would be to have an experience like\Nthat as a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.66,0:05:27.12,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}I just watched the families while I ate my meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.68,0:05:28.24,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}That sounds amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.24,0:05:30.44,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}So, what did you do once you got to Hokkaido?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.56,0:05:35.74,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}I went to another inn. I headed over to the Otaru area.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.74,0:05:42.72,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}The ocean was beautiful there too. Apparently,\NOtaru is considered one of the three most scenic spots in Hokkaido.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.92,0:05:43.52,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.72,0:05:50.42,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Yeah.\NI stayed at a slightly pricey inn with a beautiful view of the ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.42,0:05:54.36,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}I just spent my time soaking in the hot springs and eating delicious food.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.00,0:05:57.20,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Since I was alone, I could do whatever I wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.84,0:05:58.88,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Treating yourself is so important.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.16,0:06:03.24,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}It really is. It was the first time in a\Nwhile I spent a ton of money on a trip, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.36,0:06:05.08,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Well, that's exactly what money is for.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.14,0:06:05.64,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.64,0:06:11.04,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Plus, there's no cell service on the ship. They had Wi-Fi, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.60,0:06:09.24,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Oh, that's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.04,0:06:17.00,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}On the ship I took, you could only use it twice for 30 minutes each.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.00,0:06:23.06,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}So in a way, it was like a digital detox. I brought books to read,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.06,0:06:29.86,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}and I have a notebook\Nwhere I write down things about acting and my work.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.86,0:06:34.00,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}I used that to reflect on things. It felt like a proper solo journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.23,0:06:34.73,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}That sounds so fulfilling.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.52,0:06:37.12,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}It seems like it'd be easier to focus that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.24,0:06:38.48,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}It really was.
Comment: 0,0:06:39.07,0:06:39.57,Rina Honnizumi,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary — review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.07,0:06:39.57,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}That sounds nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.08,0:06:40.88,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}How about you, Rina?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.24,0:06:43.56,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Actually, Rina likes traveling alone too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.24,0:06:50.24,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}I love hot springs, so I decided to go somewhere with nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.24,0:06:54.28,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}The other day,\NI suddenly found out I had two days off starting the next day.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.84,0:07:00.52,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}So I booked a place right then and went to Kinugawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.57,0:07:01.07,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.96,0:07:03.24,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}I'd been wanting to go to a river for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.32,0:07:04.50,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.50,0:07:05.16,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}That's lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.52,0:07:08.88,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}And I had a full view of the river from my room. It's pretty similar!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.40,0:07:11.36,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}The only difference is the river versus the ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.36,0:07:13.32,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Rina just wanted to be healed by the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.92,0:07:20.12,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}I soaked in the hot springs,\Nand I always decide to do a digital detox when I go to an inn.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.24,0:07:21.28,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Yeah, we're exactly the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.08,0:07:28.10,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}I just stayed in the inn and read books. the view was so beautiful this time,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.10,0:07:32.24,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}that I spent the whole time on the balcony listening to the sound of the river.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.93,0:07:29.43,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Ah...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.36,0:07:33.00,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}We're way too similar.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.28,0:07:35.16,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}We really are.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.83,0:07:35.33,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.16,0:07:36.16,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}In how we relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.07,0:07:36.57,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.10,0:07:37.60,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.60,0:07:44.14,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Sometimes I just want to see or be near water. I love the ocean too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.41,0:07:42.91,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}I want to soak in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.14,0:07:46.08,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}I end up going to Atami every now and then.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.20,0:07:46.76,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Since it's close.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.20,0:07:48.96,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Minori goes to Atami a lot too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.08,0:07:50.64,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Now Rina wants to go to Hokkaido.
Comment: 0,0:07:50.88,0:07:51.80,Minori Suzuki,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary — review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.88,0:07:51.80,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}That sounds nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.88,0:07:53.44,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}I'd love to see the ocean in Hokkaido too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.44,0:07:55.12,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}It really is lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.88,0:07:57.68,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}I think going by ferry is a great idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.68,0:08:06.52,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}When you factor in flights and hotels,\Ntaking the ferry might even be a bit cheaper, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.75,0:08:06.25,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.52,0:08:12.08,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}As long as you don't get seasick,\Nit's perfect for people who love the ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.16,0:08:13.56,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}I've heard Oarai is a nice place too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.64,0:08:14.68,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Oh, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.68,0:08:20.00,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}I only really saw the ferry terminal, but the air was so fresh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.00,0:08:24.72,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}It was only for a short time,\Nbut since it had just rained, there was a rainbow...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.32,0:08:30.26,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}The sky was so clear and beautiful.\NI'd love to actually sightsee in Oarai next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.26,0:08:35.12,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}There were definitely a lot of people heading that way, so... yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.04,0:08:37.84,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}I hear they have a lot of wonderful traditional inns there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.96,0:08:39.32,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Ah, the list of places I want to visit just keeps growing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.37,0:08:39.87,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}That's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.40,0:08:41.54,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}It really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.54,0:08:43.64,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Looks like we both have some nice summer memories after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.76,0:08:44.52,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Yeah, I'm glad.
Comment: 0,0:08:45.60,0:08:52.04,Rina Honnizumi,,0,0,0,corner,=== Corner: Listener Mail ===
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.60,0:08:52.04,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}All right, then.\NLet's move on and read some of the listener mail we've received.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.19,0:08:50.69,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.89,0:08:52.39,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Yeah.
Comment: 0,0:08:52.76,0:09:02.66,Rina Honnizumi,,0,0,0,corner,=== Corner: Contact Notebook ===
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.76,0:08:53.98,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Oh, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.98,0:08:55.30,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Before we do that,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.30,0:09:02.66,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}we'll also be leaving a comment in the contact notebook for the next pair of hosts during the ending.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.66,0:09:04.80,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}During the ending, huh? Let's start thinking of something.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.47,0:09:04.97,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Right.
Comment: 0,0:09:04.80,0:09:10.80,Rina Honnizumi,,0,0,0,corner,=== Corner: Listener Mail ===
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.80,0:09:10.80,Rina Honnizumi,host_meta,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Okay, so let's get back to it. This first one is from Radio name: 4B.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.80,0:09:12.12,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.12,0:09:13.16,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Probably like the pencil lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.36,0:09:15.28,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}They must like the dark ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.44,0:09:16.14,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.14,0:09:19.28,Rina Honnizumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}"Honnizumi-san, Suzuki-san, kon-more, and hello."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.55,0:09:20.05,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.32,0:09:21.06,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.06,0:09:22.18,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Thanks for writing in.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.18,0:09:25.40,Rina Honnizumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}"I realized that I haven't eaten any shaved ice yet this year."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.92,0:09:29.76,Rina Honnizumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}"It's been so hot outside that I haven't felt like going out at all, so I think that's why."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.87,0:09:30.37,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}I bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.16,0:09:34.96,Rina Honnizumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}"There's a festival at the end of the month, so I'm planning to go eat some there."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.96,0:09:37.04,Rina Honnizumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}"Have you two eaten any shaved ice yet?"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.60,0:09:38.12,Minori Suzuki,host_meta,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}That's what they sent in.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.28,0:09:42.36,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}I wonder\Nif the festival is happening right around the time this episode airs.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.17,0:09:41.67,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}True.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.29,0:09:42.79,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}That sounds nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.40,0:09:44.04,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}I hope they got to eat some.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.36,0:09:45.68,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Yeah, that'd be great.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.68,0:09:46.92,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Have you eaten any?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.56,0:09:48.52,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}I don't think I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.60,0:09:51.00,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}I haven't either.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.08,0:09:58.40,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}I keep seeing photos of really fancy,\NInstagrammable shaved ice on social media, but...
Comment: 0,0:09:58.76,0:10:03.80,Minori Suzuki,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary — review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.76,0:10:03.80,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}I've never actually said I wanted to go to a shop like that,\Nbut I've always admired them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.11,0:10:02.61,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Same here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.08,0:10:04.34,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.34,0:10:08.45,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}some people really go around to all these different shaved ice shops,\Nand...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.45,0:10:09.52,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}how should I put it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.52,0:10:15.08,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}It's not just your standard strawberry syrup.\NThey have things like pumpkin cream shaved ice,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.08,0:10:17.78,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}and it seems like they even have vegetable-based ones too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.78,0:10:21.96,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Right? It's so fancy. And people\Nwho really love it will even eat it in the winter.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.64,0:10:24.24,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Shaved ice in the winter sounds nice too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.29,0:10:24.79,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.80,0:10:26.96,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}It's like eating ice cream in a warm room.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.16,0:10:27.88,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}That sounds pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.36,0:10:29.28,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}I'd love to try it sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.19,0:10:29.88,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Definitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.88,0:10:31.36,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Did you go to any festivals?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.84,0:10:32.68,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}I didn't go to any festivals.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.48,0:10:36.20,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}I don't think I even happened to stumble across one this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.20,0:10:43.48,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}I see. I actually went to a fireworks display,\Nso I've been fully enjoying summer.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.04,0:10:47.76,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}But I only looked at the shaved ice; I didn't actually eat any.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.76,0:10:50.32,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Oh, right, they have those food stalls and everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.44,0:11:00.42,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}But when I went to Hokkaido like I mentioned earlier,\NI ate that famous melon topped with soft-serve ice cream.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.42,0:11:06.88,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}As for ice cream... yeah,\Neven at the airport on the way back—I flew home—well...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.88,0:11:12.90,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}New Chitose Airport has so many shops selling soft-serve ice cream.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.90,0:11:16.00,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}I carefully picked out one delicious one and ate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.96,0:11:18.04,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}There are really that many?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.16,0:11:18.76,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}So many.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.40,0:11:20.16,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}I wouldn't be able to choose.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.28,0:11:22.28,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Exactly. So that's how it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.17,0:11:22.67,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.04,0:11:24.24,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}I really want some shaved ice now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.39,0:11:24.89,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.12,0:11:26.40,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Thanks for the letter!
Comment: 0,0:11:27.16,0:11:31.08,Minori Suzuki,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary — review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.16,0:11:31.08,Minori Suzuki,host_meta,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Um, the next one is from Hogu-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.31,0:11:28.81,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.81,0:11:31.31,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.08,0:11:32.24,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Thank you for writing in.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.36,0:11:32.96,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.92,0:11:35.84,Minori Suzuki,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}"Honnizumi-san, Suzuki-san, good evening."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.04,0:11:36.68,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Good evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.88,0:11:43.40,Minori Suzuki,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}"If this mail is being read, I'm probably in the middle of a desperate struggle to finish my summer homework."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.28,0:11:51.36,Minori Suzuki,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}"I finished the time-consuming stuff like independent research early with my parents, but I'm sure I still haven't finished my workbooks."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.83,0:11:49.33,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Oh, how responsible.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.48,0:11:53.32,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}The word "workbooks" sounds so cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.31,0:11:53.81,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}It is cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.72,0:11:58.26,Minori Suzuki,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}"Are you two the type to get things done ahead of time?"
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.26,0:12:01.20,Minori Suzuki,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}"Also, how were you back when you were students?"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.32,0:12:02.50,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.50,0:12:03.96,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}This is a tough one.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.08,0:12:05.08,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}It really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.95,0:12:05.50,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.50,0:12:09.27,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Well, you probably gathered this from the opening,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.27,0:12:15.68,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}but back when Suzuki Minori was a student,\NI was a total mess who put everything off.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.03,0:12:09.53,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.67,0:12:11.17,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.11,0:12:13.61,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.40,0:12:21.29,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}But Suzuki Minori did have the habit of actually turning in my homework,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.29,0:12:23.40,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}so I always made the deadlines.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.40,0:12:26.24,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}I'm glad I at least had that going for me now that I'm an adult.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.72,0:12:27.76,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}You have to be responsible about that, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.88,0:12:31.48,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}True, but if you ask if I was doing it properly...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.13,0:12:32.63,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.76,0:12:42.76,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}I have this one really sneaky side to me.\NYou know how the first class for each subject is on a different day?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.83,0:12:43.33,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.16,0:12:46.36,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}I would keep putting it off until the very last second before\Nthat specific class.
Comment: 0,0:12:46.44,0:12:47.56,Rina Honnizumi,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary — review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.44,0:12:47.56,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}No, but I always made it in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.44,0:12:50.76,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Also, I used the "I forgot it" excuse a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.64,0:12:55.08,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Like, "I did it, but I forgot to bring it with me."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.55,0:12:53.05,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.76,0:12:56.84,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}I somehow managed to get by.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.36,0:12:58.56,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Well, as long as you managed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.48,0:13:00.46,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}That's all that matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.46,0:13:01.92,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Since you're here now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.52,0:13:06.16,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}True, I somehow... no,\Nit's really thanks to all the people around me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.82,0:13:06.32,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.32,0:13:07.72,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}How about now that you're an adult?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.36,0:13:11.94,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Even as an adult, Ena still does it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.94,0:13:14.54,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Every now and then, Ena cuts it pretty close.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.54,0:13:16.76,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}You know how there are deadlines?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.76,0:13:17.15,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Like,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.15,0:13:22.92,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}"Please submit this questionnaire by this date," or "Reply by this time."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.03,0:13:25.71,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.59,0:13:26.32,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.71,0:13:26.39,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.32,0:13:27.16,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.05,0:13:27.55,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.40,0:13:29.00,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}To my managers...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.32,0:13:29.98,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Thank you for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.98,0:13:32.28,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Seriously, thank you so much, managers.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.65,0:13:33.15,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.20,0:13:33.92,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}That definitely happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.92,0:13:34.88,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}How about you, Ringo-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.88,0:13:35.38,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}In that regard.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.44,0:13:38.84,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}For Shizuku, if the switch is on, I can work hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.84,0:13:46.00,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}I usually do things ahead of time,\Nbut when my switch is off, I procrastinate on everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.44,0:13:47.52,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}That work switch is so important.
Comment: 0,0:13:47.64,0:13:50.80,Rina Honnizumi,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary — review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.64,0:13:50.80,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Right? It would be great if\Nthat motivation switch just stayed on all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.95,0:13:51.45,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.55,0:13:52.05,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}But it's not that easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.12,0:13:53.56,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}The "off" switch is just too powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.72,0:13:54.24,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Oh, I totally get that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.16,0:13:56.04,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}It really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.24,0:13:58.56,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Good luck with everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.08,0:14:03.78,Rina Honnizumi,host_meta,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Alright, let's move on. This next one is from Radio name: Mutsuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.78,0:14:08.08,Rina Honnizumi,host_meta,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}"Rina Honnizumi-san and Minori Suzuki-san, kon-more, kon-niigo."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.40,0:14:09.60,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Kon-more, kon-niigo!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.12,0:14:10.86,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}That makes me happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.86,0:14:17.84,Rina Honnizumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}"I was grinding for a ProSeka event the other day, and I had Sekaraji playing while I was doing my runs."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.50,0:14:19.00,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.00,0:14:24.28,Rina Honnizumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}"The cast's talk was so funny and soothing that the time just flew by. Do you two have anything that helps you get work done?"
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.28,0:14:28.08,Rina Honnizumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}"Do you two have anything that helps you get work done?"
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.56,0:14:30.64,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}They're so skilled!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.88,0:14:34.16,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}I mean, if they're doing runs, that means they're playing the game...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.36,0:14:37.56,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}So they're listening to us talk while playing a rhythm game.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.72,0:14:38.84,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}That's like Prince Shotoku levels of multitasking.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.96,0:14:40.36,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Right? That's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.53,0:14:41.03,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.92,0:14:42.64,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}They must have the songs memorized by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.67,0:14:43.17,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Definitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.16,0:14:47.56,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}If they've played enough to know the notes and charts by heart,\Nthat's really flattering.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.48,0:14:45.24,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.72,0:14:48.48,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}We really appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.40,0:14:50.32,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Something that helps us get things done...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.73,0:14:51.31,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}What could it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.31,0:14:51.92,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}I wonder.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.52,0:14:53.08,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Let's see...
Comment: 0,0:14:54.04,0:14:59.36,Rina Honnizumi,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary — review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.04,0:14:59.36,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}When Ena goes to sleep,\NEna often has a radio show or a stream playing in the background.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.38,0:14:59.88,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.88,0:15:01.24,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}I see, so you listen to people talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.40,0:15:02.64,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Yeah, somehow...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.96,0:15:08.48,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}It helps Ena feel at ease and fall asleep.\NBut that's not for when Ena is working.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.80,0:15:10.48,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Ah, right, that's for sleeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.64,0:15:17.44,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}When Ena is working,\NEna might put on one of those background music videos on YouTube...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.44,0:15:19.72,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Ena plays those sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.20,0:15:21.16,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Ah, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.76,0:15:24.48,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Do you play anything when you're reading a book?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.60,0:15:26.76,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Oh, Shizuku doesn't play anything when reading.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.76,0:15:28.76,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}The sound just gets in the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.16,0:15:30.00,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Ah, too much information.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.03,0:15:30.53,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.61,0:15:31.11,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}That makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.40,0:15:32.44,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}It's strange, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.04,0:15:34.12,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Yeah, Shizuku prefers silence.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.33,0:15:34.83,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.04,0:15:37.32,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Is it silent when you're checking your work materials too?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.68,0:15:44.12,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}For checking, it's either silence or that background music,\Nbut Ena doesn't play it loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.68,0:15:46.44,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}It's just barely audible.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.16,0:15:48.20,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.15,0:15:48.80,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.80,0:15:50.64,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}But Ena thinks Ena generally prefers silence.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.65,0:15:51.15,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.16,0:15:55.84,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}When Ena needs to focus on a story, Ena prefers silence.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.77,0:15:56.27,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.71,0:15:57.40,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.40,0:15:59.56,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}What about when you're reading manga?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.24,0:16:07.64,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Shizuku usually ends up playing some kind of music.
Comment: 0,0:16:01.43,0:16:01.93,Minori Suzuki,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary — review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.43,0:16:01.93,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.61,0:16:08.29,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.29,0:16:16.94,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Also, when I'm reading,\NI often look for Western music or BGM that fits the story.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.45,0:16:14.95,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.94,0:16:21.20,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}The other day, I was reading a book set in the Mayan civilization...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.32,0:16:22.68,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}You really read all sorts of books, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.92,0:16:23.80,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}I just love variety.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.67,0:16:24.17,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.44,0:16:27.71,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}At the time, I searched for free music
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.71,0:16:33.76,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}that sounded like the Mayan civilization,\Nand things actually came up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.71,0:16:34.21,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.24,0:16:36.92,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Listening to that really gets me into the mood.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.24,0:16:37.92,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}I get it, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.00,0:16:38.68,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}That's how it feels.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.52,0:16:41.12,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}If it's an action story, I'll pick something intense...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.48,0:16:42.44,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Ah, right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.96,0:16:47.88,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}And if it's set by the sea, then I'll listen to...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.20,0:16:49.52,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Oh, that's nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.72,0:16:52.68,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}...ambient ocean sounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.63,0:16:53.13,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.01,0:16:54.63,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.63,0:16:57.64,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Do you have specific books you like to bring on trips?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.20,0:17:08.76,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Oh, when I travel, I try to bring books I've already started.\NI usually read several books at the same time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.81,0:17:04.31,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.87,0:17:09.37,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}That's impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.12,0:17:11.17,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}My mood changes,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.17,0:17:16.10,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}so I might feel like reading one thing one day and something else the next.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.10,0:17:20.76,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Since the genres are all over the place,\NI really want to narrow it down when I travel, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.92,0:17:21.48,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.56,0:17:22.98,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Because I want to pack light.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.98,0:17:29.04,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}But if I start reading and realize I'm not in the mood for\Nthat specific book, I regret it so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.93,0:17:29.43,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}I bet.
Comment: 0,0:17:30.28,0:17:35.78,Minori Suzuki,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary — review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.28,0:17:35.78,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}I'll skim through a few and then pick the one I feel like reading right then.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.78,0:17:37.20,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Wow, that's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.76,0:17:38.42,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}So impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.42,0:17:40.28,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}It's like... what do you call it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.28,0:17:41.80,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}You know, that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.80,0:17:42.78,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}It's like a professional... what's the word?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.78,0:17:46.04,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Like someone who picks the perfect drink for a person's mood...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.04,0:17:47.58,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}What do you call that again?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.58,0:17:48.19,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Like...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.16,0:17:50.68,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Oh, uh... not a meister, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.80,0:17:53.46,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}A professional like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.57,0:17:53.07,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}A pro.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.46,0:17:54.96,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Now I can't think of it either.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.52,0:17:56.84,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Like, "This is the one for you today."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.60,0:17:59.00,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Yeah, like a professional book curator.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.51,0:18:00.01,Default,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.00,0:18:02.76,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Choosing something that fits your current mindset...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.81,0:18:03.31,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.80,0:18:06.04,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}That's so cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.04,0:18:09.72,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Ena really respects people who can read books like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.40,0:18:11.12,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.24,0:18:12.56,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}I totally get it. Books are special like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.47,0:18:12.97,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.72,0:18:17.14,Rina Honnizumi,host_meta,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}All right, thank you so much for writing in, Sangatsu-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.14,0:18:19.56,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}That's all for this letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.25,0:18:19.75,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.56,0:18:23.96,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}We're always looking for questions and topics you'd like to ask the ProSeka cast.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.08,0:18:24.72,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}We are!
Comment: 0,0:18:25.64,0:18:28.28,Rina Honnizumi,,0,0,0,corner,=== Corner: Song ===
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.64,0:18:28.28,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}With that, let's play a song.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.27,0:18:28.77,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.32,0:18:34.85,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}This song features Shizuku as the lead,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.85,0:18:45.92,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}and I hope you can feel the changing weather of her heart as you listen along.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.39,0:18:31.89,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.97,0:18:35.47,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Mhm.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.49,0:18:46.99,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Well then...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.81,0:21:06.31,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}...
Comment: 0,0:21:10.96,0:21:14.20,Minori Suzuki,,0,0,0,corner,=== Corner: Theme Mail ===
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.96,0:21:14.20,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}For this episode, we asked for listener mail on this theme:
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.88,0:21:17.04,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}"Things to look forward to in autumn."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.08,0:21:19.72,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}How peaceful.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.71,0:21:20.21,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}It really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.41,0:21:20.91,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}So peaceful.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.48,0:21:26.20,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}The summer heat is still lingering,\Nbut autumn will be here before we know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.20,0:21:26.37,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}So,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.37,0:21:30.56,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}we asked everyone to send in what they're looking forward to this fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.56,0:21:33.20,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Let's get right into the mail.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.20,0:21:33.92,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.44,0:21:37.76,Minori Suzuki,host_meta,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}This one is from Radio name: Freshly Fried Fries.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.76,0:21:38.84,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.85,0:21:39.35,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Great name.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.92,0:21:43.20,Minori Suzuki,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}"Honnizumi-san, Suzuki-san, good evening."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.28,0:21:43.88,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Good evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.00,0:21:47.32,Minori Suzuki,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}"What I'm looking forward to in autumn is the maple leaves."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.32,0:21:48.28,Minori Suzuki,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}"The autumn colors."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.84,0:21:51.62,Minori Suzuki,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}"I'm going to Kyoto in September to see the foliage."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.62,0:21:55.56,Minori Suzuki,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}"I usually go to Kyoto in the summer, so this is my first time going in the fall."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.12,0:22:01.22,Minori Suzuki,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}"I've seen photos of the leaves at places like Kiyomizu-dera and thought they were beautiful,"
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.22,0:22:03.78,Minori Suzuki,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}"so I'm really excited to go see them for myself."
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.59,0:22:04.09,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Oh, lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.78,0:22:06.04,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Have you ever been?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.12,0:22:06.92,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}I have, I have, I have.
Comment: 0,0:22:07.04,0:22:13.04,Minori Suzuki,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary — review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.04,0:22:13.04,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Yeah, Ena used to go there alone all the time,\Nthough Ena hasn't been able to go much these past few years.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.13,0:22:13.63,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.88,0:22:21.60,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Ena usually goes around summer, like September,\Nso Ena has never actually been there
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.24,0:22:26.56,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}when the autumn leaves are at their peak.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.76,0:22:28.04,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}It's hard to time it right, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.60,0:22:32.08,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Yeah, it really depends on the weather each year.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.48,0:22:33.12,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.72,0:22:35.24,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}But it sounds lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.12,0:22:41.72,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}They say it's going to be a warm autumn in the west this year,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.24,0:22:43.36,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}so the timing might end up shifting a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.36,0:22:44.08,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}I wonder how it'll be.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.08,0:22:51.16,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Even if the leaves haven't changed yet,\Nthe greenery is still beautiful,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.16,0:22:54.96,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}so I'm not sure if Potato-san will see the red leaves or not...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.24,0:22:56.00,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.16,0:23:00.68,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}But whether they see them or not,\NI'm sure the scenery will be wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.69,0:23:01.19,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.08,0:23:03.04,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}I'm jealous.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.52,0:23:04.12,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Kyoto, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.36,0:23:07.80,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}I don't know how old they are,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.48,0:23:09.52,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}but it's a nice way to spend time.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.48,0:23:11.04,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}It's really lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.95,0:23:11.45,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Mhm.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.21,0:23:12.71,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}So sophisticated.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.37,0:23:13.87,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}It's wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.80,0:23:18.12,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}All right, let's keep moving through these.
Comment: 0,0:23:18.12,0:23:22.56,Minori Suzuki,,0,0,0,corner,=== Corner: Listener Mail ===
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.12,0:23:22.56,Minori Suzuki,host_meta,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Next, we have some listener mail from Radio name: Yusuke Ena-oshi.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.56,0:23:24.16,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.88,0:23:25.76,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}We appreciate your support.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.92,0:23:29.24,Minori Suzuki,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}"Honnizumi-san, Suzuki-san, kon-niigo!"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.32,0:23:30.28,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Kon-niigo!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.84,0:23:33.46,Minori Suzuki,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}"This is the first time I've ever sent in listener mail."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.46,0:23:34.62,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}That's wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.62,0:23:35.66,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Everyone's so sophisticated.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.66,0:23:40.24,Minori Suzuki,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}"What I look forward to in autumn is going for walks while feeling the cool breeze."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.32,0:23:41.40,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Oh, that's the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.35,0:23:41.86,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}The absolute best.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.86,0:23:43.33,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}It seems like everyone...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.33,0:23:44.00,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}It's nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.00,0:23:44.84,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}So mature.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.84,0:23:51.06,Minori Suzuki,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}"I don't handle the heat well, so I don't feel like going outside in the summer unless I have to,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.06,0:23:55.62,Minori Suzuki,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}but once autumn comes and it gets cooler, I go for walks quite often.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.62,0:24:01.64,Minori Suzuki,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Seeing the autumn leaves and the sunset during those walks is very healing for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.64,0:24:10.08,Minori Suzuki,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Last year, the cool period was so short that I didn't walk much,\Nso I hope I can go for plenty of walks this year."
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.44,0:24:13.08,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Minori loves going for walks too.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.08,0:24:21.40,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}I try to do it normally, but yeah, summer is tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.52,0:24:23.00,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Rina isn't good with the heat either.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.12,0:24:23.72,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.72,0:24:26.84,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}You can get heatstroke even if you're careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.85,0:24:27.35,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.56,0:24:32.08,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}I hope it keeps getting cooler so we have more to look forward to.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.68,0:24:33.44,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}That sounds lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.44,0:24:37.80,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}The days getting shorter has its own emotional vibe, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.64,0:24:39.20,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}It really does.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.20,0:24:41.12,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}I wonder if it's starting to change already.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.12,0:24:42.64,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Once September hits, it usually changes quite a bit.
Comment: 0,0:24:42.76,0:24:44.60,Minori Suzuki,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary — review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.76,0:24:44.60,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Right, it feels like it'll be here soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.61,0:24:45.11,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Yeah, definitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.64,0:24:47.60,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Even the insects, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.60,0:24:49.32,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}The sounds they make will change too.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.33,0:24:49.83,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}True.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.00,0:24:50.80,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}That sounds lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.88,0:24:52.24,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Man, everyone's ideas are so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.24,0:24:53.40,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}They really are.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.76,0:24:54.36,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}It's very chic.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.44,0:24:54.96,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Very chic.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.76,0:24:57.24,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Alright, let's keep moving through these.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.48,0:24:59.98,Rina Honnizumi,host_meta,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Okay, next is from Popopo-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.98,0:25:01.16,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.27,0:25:01.77,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.80,0:25:04.68,Rina Honnizumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}"Honnizumi-san, Suzuki-san, kon-niigo-niigo!"
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.80,0:25:06.14,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Kon-niigo-niigo!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.14,0:25:09.64,Minori Suzuki,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}"What I'm looking forward to this autumn is the ProSeka Kanshasai."
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.24,0:25:15.18,Minori Suzuki,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}"Since this year's Kanshasai will be the first time all four members of MORE MORE JUMP! are together,"
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.18,0:25:18.44,Minori Suzuki,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}"I'm really excited to see what kind of performance it will be."
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.32,0:25:20.44,Minori Suzuki,host_meta,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Thank you for the letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.00,0:25:22.28,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}So, MMJ... right.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.84,0:25:23.72,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Like at the Symphony and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.32,0:25:29.98,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}We've had a few chances to get all four of us together for things like livestreams,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.98,0:25:32.60,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}but apparently this is the first time
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.48,0:25:34.26,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}we'll all be at Kanshasai together.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.26,0:25:37.36,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}So it'll be the first time I get to see all four of them together in person.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.16,0:25:41.14,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}I've seen photos, but still.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.14,0:25:41.40,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Man,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.40,0:25:46.55,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}the MORE MORE JUMP! members have such incredible passion for being in MMJ.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.55,0:25:47.25,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}It's really something.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.25,0:25:47.91,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}That makes Rina happy.
Comment: 0,0:25:47.91,0:25:54.60,Minori Suzuki,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary — review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.91,0:25:54.60,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Everyone is like that,\Nbut the sheer determination to make it happen, how do I put it...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.60,0:25:56.44,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}it's just incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.44,0:25:57.12,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Aww, that makes me so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.84,0:25:58.94,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}I can really feel
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.94,0:26:03.64,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}that vibe of "we're going to do this as the four of us, no matter what."
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.64,0:26:08.08,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Watching from the side,\Nit makes me want to tell the other three about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.31,0:26:06.81,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}That's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.60,0:26:09.24,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.36,0:26:11.00,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}I think it's really wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.08,0:26:15.80,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}I wonder if rehearsals have already started by the time this airs.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.44,0:26:19.12,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Oh, that's right, you guys have to dance.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.12,0:26:25.04,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}N25's performance style doesn't involve much dancing, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.04,0:26:26.72,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}I guess it's different for every unit.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.72,0:26:27.40,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Yeah, it really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.40,0:26:32.80,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}MMJ probably dances the most,\Nthough I'm sure the other teams work hard too.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.44,0:26:39.52,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}True.\NWe get choreography for every song and sing live while doing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.12,0:26:45.40,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}I feel like we usually start about a month before the actual show.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.40,0:26:47.56,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,270)}Wow. You must do a lot of practicing on your own too, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.76,0:26:49.56,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Ena Shinonome does a ton of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.56,0:26:55.44,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Ena Shinonome just feels like she has to keep doing reps until she gets it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.44,0:26:57.32,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}It's pretty nerve-wracking, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.12,0:26:58.84,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}It really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.84,0:27:01.48,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Especially since they're idols.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.48,0:27:05.80,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}The characters grow as idols too, so in terms of acting,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.80,0:27:08.12,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}it makes you feel like you really have to give it your all.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.12,0:27:08.92,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}You really get fired up.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.92,0:27:09.80,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Especially this time of year.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.80,0:27:11.60,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}I'm so grateful for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.60,0:27:13.06,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}I wonder what songs we'll be singing.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.06,0:27:15.64,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Hehe, please look forward to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.64,0:27:17.88,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}N25 will have all four members together this year too, right?
Comment: 0,0:27:17.88,0:27:18.64,Minori Suzuki,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary — review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.88,0:27:18.64,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}I'm so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.64,0:27:21.80,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Last year was the first time...\Nwell, we were all together for the Symphony,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.80,0:27:24.88,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}but last year's Anniversary was the first time we were all there together.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.88,0:27:33.02,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}And while it's definitely fun to sing as a trio or a duo,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.02,0:27:38.76,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}when all four of us are finally together for the original vocal parts,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.28,0:27:45.56,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}it really makes Ena feel like,\N"Ah, we really are a four-person unit."
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.08,0:27:48.40,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}It's like the last puzzle piece finally fits.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.40,0:27:49.48,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}It really felt like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.48,0:27:55.12,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Last year, it felt like Ena finally became Ena, in a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.84,0:28:01.42,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}I'm sure it's the same for MMJ.\NYou were all together for the Symphony and did some dancing,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.42,0:28:04.21,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}but this will feel even more complete, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.21,0:28:04.76,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}I'm sure it will.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.76,0:28:05.52,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}I'm fired up!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.20,0:28:06.96,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}I can't wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.96,0:28:08.06,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Me too, I'm looking forward to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.06,0:28:09.76,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}We're in your hands again this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.44,0:28:11.60,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}All right, let's move on to the next one.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.16,0:28:13.16,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.16,0:28:15.78,Minori Suzuki,host_meta,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}This one is from Suirenka.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.78,0:28:16.92,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.60,0:28:19.00,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Everyone is so kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.00,0:28:21.26,Minori Suzuki,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}"Honnizumi-san, Suzuki-san, kon-niigo-niigo!"
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.26,0:28:22.36,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Kon-niigo-niigo!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.92,0:28:28.32,Minori Suzuki,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}"I love N25's Ena and Mizuki, and MMJ's Shizuku-sama."
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.64,0:28:31.26,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}You just want to add the "-sama," don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.26,0:28:35.56,Minori Suzuki,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}"When I heard you two were hosting, I decided to write in for the first time."
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.08,0:28:36.92,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.92,0:28:39.98,Minori Suzuki,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}"There are two things I'm looking forward to this autumn."
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.98,0:28:45.60,Minori Suzuki,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}"First is the ProSeka Unit Fan Meeting: Nightcord at 25:00 in Oita."
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.32,0:28:51.82,Minori Suzuki,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}"Back in high school, N25's songs supported me through the stress of entrance exams, and I passed!"
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.82,0:28:55.28,Minori Suzuki,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}"I've been living on my own since this spring."
Comment: 0,0:28:56.04,0:28:59.80,Minori Suzuki,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary — review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.04,0:28:59.80,Minori Suzuki,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}"I'm finally able to attend my first fan meeting, which has been a long-held dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.80,0:29:03.12,Minori Suzuki,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}It feels like a dream to be able to meet the cast members I love so much,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.12,0:29:06.04,Minori Suzuki,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}so I want to enjoy it to the fullest as a reward to myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.80,0:29:07.70,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}I'll do my best!"
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.70,0:29:11.72,Minori Suzuki,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}"The second thing is my first university cultural festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.72,0:29:16.00,Minori Suzuki,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Up until high school, I always had studying in the back of my mind,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.00,0:29:19.00,Minori Suzuki,listener_mail,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}but this year I'm excited to just have fun with everything I've got."
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.80,0:29:23.02,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Wow, I really want them to enjoy both of those things.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.02,0:29:26.10,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Living alone as a college student... that's impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.10,0:29:27.82,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}It's only been about four months for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.82,0:29:29.84,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Yeah, almost five months now.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.01,0:29:31.73,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}That's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.73,0:29:34.40,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}A new environment can be so tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.00,0:29:35.19,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Man,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.19,0:29:39.20,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}getting listener mail like this really makes Ena feel like she needs to work harder.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.20,0:29:43.42,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Knowing\Nthat some people are coming to see us as a reward for themselves...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.42,0:29:44.24,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}It really is like that, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.08,0:29:50.44,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}It just makes Shizuku want to make sure it's a wonderful reward for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.44,0:29:51.44,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}I'm so moved by this.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.44,0:29:56.84,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}To finally meet the people you've been listening to,\Nwho have supported you emotionally...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.84,0:29:57.76,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.84,0:30:00.04,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}It makes me happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.56,0:30:02.00,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Right, the event is in Oita.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.00,0:30:04.68,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}It's the week after this radio episode, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.28,0:30:06.68,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}It's coming up soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.68,0:30:11.46,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}I'm going too, and it's Ena's first time in Oita,\Nso I'm looking forward to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.46,0:30:13.20,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}I hope you get to eat some delicious food.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.96,0:30:15.12,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}I wonder if they'll let me eat some.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.09,0:30:17.67,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}I'm sure they will.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.67,0:30:18.26,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}It'll be delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.26,0:30:20.16,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}I heard there's going to be a relay and stuff too.
Comment: 0,0:30:20.16,0:30:21.10,Minori Suzuki,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary — review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.16,0:30:21.10,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Oh, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.10,0:30:27.84,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}If N25 works hard,\Nmaybe that will become a prize for us in MMJ.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.68,0:30:30.90,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Right, it'll probably come back around eventually.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.90,0:30:31.96,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Since it goes in a full circle.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.56,0:30:33.33,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}I'm counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.33,0:30:33.85,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Yeah, I'll do my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.44,0:30:34.96,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}It's in Oita, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.96,0:30:35.57,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.57,0:30:36.82,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Man, I'm looking forward to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.82,0:30:40.12,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}The venue is called iichiko Grand Theater.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.93,0:30:41.43,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Like the shochu?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.16,0:30:43.90,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Yeah, exactly like the shochu.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.90,0:30:44.72,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.72,0:30:45.56,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}I wonder if we can drink some.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.56,0:30:49.75,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}There's a chance it's not that,\Nbut if we can drink it, that'd be great too.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.75,0:30:50.28,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}True.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.28,0:30:58.00,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}But for the rest of MMJ...\NI can see Hon-chan and Yoshioka-san drinking,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.60,0:31:01.80,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}but I can't really picture the other two doing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.04,0:31:04.84,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}What do you think they'd like to drink
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.84,0:31:05.60,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}with a meal?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.60,0:31:06.88,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Whoa, what would they like?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.88,0:31:07.56,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Oolong tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.56,0:31:08.06,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Oolong tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.40,0:31:10.94,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}I can definitely see them drinking tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.94,0:31:13.60,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}I see. Then I'll look forward to the tea and shochu
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.88,0:31:17.46,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}from Oita.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.46,0:31:18.52,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.52,0:31:22.52,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Right, and they mentioned there's a school festival too.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.52,0:31:23.44,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}I hope they have fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.44,0:31:25.48,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}I wonder what they'll be doing.
Comment: 0,0:31:25.48,0:31:29.30,Minori Suzuki,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary — review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.48,0:31:29.30,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Right? I wonder if university life is pretty free.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.30,0:31:32.68,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}I wonder if it gets flashier,\Nor if you can just do whatever you want...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.68,0:31:33.44,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Well, that's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.44,0:31:37.14,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Compared to middle or high school,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.14,0:31:38.04,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}you have more control over things.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.04,0:31:42.34,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Some universities even invite voice actors for talk shows,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.34,0:31:49.02,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}so since you can do so much more yourselves,\Nplease have a great time.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.02,0:31:50.52,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}I hope you enjoy it!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.56,0:31:52.20,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.72,0:31:53.56,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Definitely.
Comment: 0,0:31:54.16,0:31:57.24,Minori Suzuki,,0,0,0,corner,=== Corner: Theme Mail ===
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.16,0:31:57.24,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Alright, that's all the messages for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.24,0:31:59.24,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Thank you so much, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.08,0:32:03.74,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Our theme this time was "Things to look forward to in autumn."
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.74,0:32:05.48,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Thanks for writing in.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.88,0:32:18.48,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Ready...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.08,0:32:19.72,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}One, two... kon-niigo!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.92,0:32:35.02,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}We're wrapping things up.
Comment: 0,0:32:35.02,0:32:36.94,Minori Suzuki,,0,0,0,corner,=== Corner: Ending ===
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.02,0:32:36.94,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}It's time for the Sekaraji ending.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.94,0:32:39.90,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}We're always looking for your submissions.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.90,0:32:42.48,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}The address is sekairadio@pjsekai.jp.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.90,0:32:49.44,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Please check the official ProSeka X account for more details.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.44,0:32:52.28,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}And make sure to send your emails in early!
Comment: 0,0:32:52.28,0:32:54.72,Minori Suzuki,,0,0,0,corner,=== Corner: Listener Mail ===
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.28,0:32:54.72,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}And don't forget to include your Radio name.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.72,0:32:55.49,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.49,0:32:58.44,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}The next episode will also be a unit
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.44,0:32:59.28,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}shuffle.
Comment: 0,0:33:00.00,0:33:05.04,Minori Suzuki,,0,0,0,corner,=== Corner: Contact Notebook ===
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.00,0:33:05.04,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}So, we need to leave a comment in the contact notebook
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.04,0:33:06.56,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}for the next pair of hosts.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.76,0:33:09.76,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}We were talking about it a little bit earlier,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.56,0:33:11.82,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}and there's something we want to ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.82,0:33:12.46,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}There is.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.46,0:33:13.36,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.36,0:33:13.86,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.56,0:33:17.58,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}"What is the biggest thing you've ever forgotten?"
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.58,0:33:18.15,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Oh, that's a big one.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.20,0:33:24.30,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Well, we were talking about travel again just now,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.30,0:33:29.68,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}and I was telling her about how I forgot so many things on my trip to Hokkaido.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.20,0:33:33.26,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}So Rina-chan suggested we go with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.26,0:33:35.04,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Does anything come to mind for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.04,0:33:36.55,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Off the top of my head...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.55,0:33:37.29,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Hmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.55,0:33:39.05,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.88,0:33:41.04,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}I forgot my iPad.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.72,0:33:42.36,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}At the studio.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.04,0:33:44.96,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}You wouldn't be able to check the script!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.76,0:33:51.68,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}I was so relieved to be finished that I said my goodbyes,\Nbut then I realized my bag felt light.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.60,0:33:53.76,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Oh, and there's another one.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.16,0:34:00.64,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}You know how we always borrow microphones for the ProSeka broadcasts?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.64,0:34:02.42,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}I think I almost took one home with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.42,0:34:06.82,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}I have a friend who actually did the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.82,0:34:08.96,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}They left with the clip-on mic still attached.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.96,0:34:09.76,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Exactly.
Comment: 0,0:34:09.76,0:34:16.86,Minori Suzuki,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary — review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.76,0:34:16.86,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Anyway, the makeup artist noticed it halfway through and called me,\Nso I rushed back and returned it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.86,0:34:18.52,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}That really happened, so I guess you can't let your guard down.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.08,0:34:20.34,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}You just feel so relieved once it's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.34,0:34:24.28,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}I forgot my wallet when I went back to my hometown too.\NOh, my heart was racing.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.28,0:34:27.50,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}I went all the way to Aichi and back without a wallet.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.50,0:34:29.32,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}But, well, you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.04,0:34:32.88,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}I could pay for things with my phone, so that worked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.88,0:34:37.60,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}I'd bought my tickets online with a credit card,\Nso I could still travel, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.60,0:34:38.92,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}It was still a real scare.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.48,0:34:42.14,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Did you realize it after you arrived in Tokyo?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.14,0:34:48.48,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}No, I was on the Shinkansen heading from Tokyo to Aichi,\Nand while I was rummaging through my bag...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.48,0:34:49.88,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}I thought, "Wait, I don't have my wallet."
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.92,0:34:53.60,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}But I was already on the train, so I figured I just had to go for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.36,0:34:57.28,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}If my phone battery had died, I would've been finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.28,0:34:59.36,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}I wouldn't have been able to get through the ticket gates.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.24,0:35:01.76,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}It was a close call.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.72,0:35:05.02,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}I'm looking forward to seeing what comes out of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.02,0:35:06.12,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}I'm excited too.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.12,0:35:06.86,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.86,0:35:08.20,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.20,0:35:10.60,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Well, the time has flown by, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.44,0:35:14.64,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}It's time for us to say goodbye for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.16,0:35:20.02,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}I guess we'll see everyone again at Kanshasai or the fan meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.02,0:35:22.52,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}I wonder if I failed to sound like a proper big sister today.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.16,0:35:24.96,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Now that I think about it, I was the one forgetting things.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.52,0:35:27.92,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}I wonder what it even means to be "big sister-like."
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.92,0:35:29.82,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Ah, yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.82,0:35:32.32,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}We'd have to start by defining that, wouldn't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.32,0:35:34.34,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}We really would need a whole hour for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.34,0:35:35.04,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}For a topic like that.
Comment: 0,0:35:35.04,0:35:36.16,Minori Suzuki,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary — review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.04,0:35:36.16,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}It's perfectly fine to have a "-chan" in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.07,0:35:37.80,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.80,0:35:38.76,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Thank you very much.
Comment: 0,0:35:41.56,0:35:45.98,Minori Suzuki,,0,0,0,corner,=== Corner: Ending ===
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.56,0:35:45.98,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Well, your hosts for today were Rina Honnizumi and Minori Suzuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.98,0:35:46.58,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.58,0:35:47.44,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.12,0:35:56.88,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}This program was brought to you by Project SEKAI COLORFUL STAGE! feat.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.88,0:35:59.32,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,810)}Hatsune Miku.
